  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Temminck&apos;s Pangolin in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pangolins are facing a crisis, but it is not too late to save them! This project is to ensure the survival of the Temminck&apos;s pangolin in South Africa, by providing the rescue, rehabilitation, release and monitoring that an individual pangolin must go through so they may be successfully released back into the wild. Be part of the movement committed to giving these amazing animals a second chance in life.</narrative>
  </description>
